@page "/about"

<PageTitle>EventEase - About</PageTitle>

<div class="about-container">
    <div class="about-card">
        <h1 class="about-title">About EventEase</h1>
        <p class="about-text">
            <strong>EventEase</strong> is a modern event management application built as a comprehensive portfolio project. 
            It demonstrates the power of Blazor components, two-way data binding, form validation, and state management.
        </p>
        
        <div class="ai-badge">
            <span class="bi bi-robot"></span> Powered by Microsoft Copilot
        </div>
        
        <p class="about-text mt-3">
            Throughout the development of this project, <strong>Microsoft Copilot</strong> was utilized to accelerate component creation, debug routing issues, and optimize the overall application performance.
        </p>

        <div class="developer-credit">
            <p>Designed and Developed by</p>
            <h3>Mert Ege Cetinkaya</h3>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>